  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zambia Partner CA FY20</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is the fourth year of a Cooperative Agreement for USADF&apos;s partner organization in Zambia, RDI. Funds will be used to support staff salaries and benefits, program monitoring expenses, office and vehicle expenses, an annual audit, capacity building items, and other administrative expenses. Funds disbursed to provide liquidity in light of unanticipated shocks impacting project activities and grantee enterprises due to the COVID-19 pandemic. Funds to assist with project needs in light of fund shortage due to COVID-19.</narrative>
  </description>
